 🎓 Smart Exam Management System with Face Recognition Authentication

A secure AI-powered college examination management system built using Django, Python, Face Recognition, and SQLite that automates student authentication, exam scheduling, seat allocation, staff assignment, and secure access control.

---

 🚀 Key Features

 🔐 Secure Authentication
- Face Recognition based student login
- OTP Email Verification
- Auto-generated secure passwords
- Role-based login (Admin / Staff / Student)

 👨‍🎓 Student Module
- Face capture registration
- Profile management
- Secure biometric login
- View exam schedules
- View seat allocations

 👨‍🏫 Staff Module
- Staff registration & admin approval
- Profile management
- Invigilation schedule view
- Exam hall assignment

 🛠 Admin Module
- Manage Departments
- Manage Courses
- Manage Semesters
- Manage Subjects
- Manage Exam Halls
- Approve / Reject Students & Staff
- Schedule Exams
- Assign Invigilators
- Auto Seat Allocation System
- Reset / Modify Seat Allocations

 🧠 AI & Automation
- Face encoding & verification using face_recognition
- Conflict-free hall scheduling
- Automatic random seat allocation
- Staff clash detection
- OTP & credential email automation

---

 🛠 Tech Stack

Backend: Django, Python  
Database: SQLite  
Authentication: Face Recognition + OTP Verification  
AI/ML Libraries: NumPy, face_recognition, Pickle  
Image Processing: PIL  
Email Service: Django SMTP  
Frontend: HTML, CSS, Bootstrap

---

 ⚙ Core Algorithms
- Facial Encoding Matching
- Hall Conflict Detection
- Randomized Seat Allocation
- Staff Availability Validation
- OTP Verification Workflow

---

 📌 Highlights
✔ Biometric Authentication  
✔ Secure Exam Access Control  
✔ Automated Scheduling System  
✔ Real-time Staff Assignment  
✔ Smart Seat Allocation  
✔ Full CRUD Administration Panel

---

 🎯 Project Goal
To digitize and secure examination processes using Artificial Intelligence and automation, reducing manual errors and improving institutional efficiency.

